⚡️🇸🇾🇮🇶 Syrian intelligence, in cooperation with the Counter-Terrorism Bureau, arrested an Iraqi oil tanker driver after he entered Syrian territory.

 He is one of the leaders of the Popular Mobilization Forces (PMF) and the intelligence officer of the 30th Brigade of the Popular Mobilization Forces. He entered Syria as an oil tanker driver to gather intelligence.

